        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Scuba X1 Pro Max is Aiper's flagship all-in-one cordless robotic pool cleaner. A 9-motor system delivers 8,500 GPH suction while FlexiPath 2.0 navigation and OmniSense+ 2.0 (40 ultrasonic sensors, 360° scanning) map your pool and plan efficient cleaning paths.<br/><br/>🏊 All-in-one coverage: floor, walls, waterline, and surface skimming, in one machine.<br/>🤖 8 cleaning modes including Hero Mode (smart obstacle avoidance) and Eco Mode.<br/>⚡ Wireless charging dock, safe to dock and charge while still wet.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Your Pool, Fully Maintained. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p>Cordless, all-in-one, and built for pools up to 3,230 sq ft or 100 ft in length. The Scuba X1 Pro Max handles the entire pool, not just the floor.</p><h3>Navigation that actually maps your pool</h3><p>FlexiPath 2.0 adaptive navigation paired with OmniSense+ 2.0's 40 ultrasonic sensors scans and maps your pool in real time, planning efficient paths around steps, ladders, and corners instead of bumping into them.</p><h3>Built to clean everything, not just the floor</h3><p>Dual active front and rear scrubbing rollers handle floors and walls, while the surface-skimming function clears leaves and debris before they ever sink. Swap between the 180-micron filter for larger debris and the 3-micron filter for fine dust and algae.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Wireless charging dock</strong> – safe to charge while the unit is still wet, no exposed charging ports.</li><li><strong>Manufacturer warranty up to 3 years</strong> depending on registration and model terms.</li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Aiper's manufacturer warranty, up to 3 years depending on model and registration terms. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No installation required. Charge the unit on its wireless dock, connect to the Aiper App, and drop it in the pool. FlexiPath 2.0 begins mapping and cleaning automatically. Compatible with iOS and Android.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Cleaning &amp; Power</h3><ul><li><strong>Suction:</strong> 8,500 GPH, 9-motor system</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Floor, walls, waterline, and surface skimming</li><li><strong>Cleaning modes:</strong> 8 modes including Hero Mode and Eco Mode</li></ul><h3>Navigation &amp; Sensing</h3><ul><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> FlexiPath 2.0 adaptive path planning</li><li><strong>Sensing:</strong> OmniSense+ 2.0, 40 ultrasonic sensors, 360° scanning</li></ul><h3>Filtration &amp; Scrubbing</h3><ul><li><strong>Scrubbing:</strong> Dual active front and rear rollers</li><li><strong>Filters:</strong> Swappable 180-micron and 3-micron filters</li></ul><h3>Coverage &amp; Charging</h3><ul><li><strong>Pool size:</strong> Up to 3,230 sq ft or 100 ft in length</li><li><strong>Charging:</strong> Wireless dock, safe to charge while wet</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> App control via Aiper App; HydroComm compatible</li></ul><h3>Warranty</h3><ul><li>Manufacturer warranty up to 3 years, depending on model and registration terms</li></ul>"
